      "desc": "Apple has given up on making their own ai model and decided to partner up with Gemini, to power their Siri model. No, it isn’t api routed to Gemini, it’s just a model trained on Gemini that’s “cloud based”. You can say Apple distilled from Gemini, but legally, X.ai doesn’t know abt that one. Siri isn’t open source so we don’t know which model it was trained on but a safe bet is the Gemini flash models since the other frontier models like Gemini neon were released much later. They announced the partnership in January 2026, and released the new advanced Siri to the public on September 14 2026. This picture has Siri and Gemini flash drawn as “anime” girls. #fyp #gemini #appleintelligence #siri #ai ",
